  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f2f6fa;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      color: #1677ff;
    }

    .lesson {
      background: white;
      padding: 18px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .lesson h2 {
      color: #1677ff;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .lesson p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    pre {
      background: #222;
      color: white;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .back {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      background: #1677ff;
      color: white;
      padding: 13px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>🌐 Web Development</h1>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 1: Web Development waa maxay?</h2>
  <p>
    Web Development waa samaynta iyo horumarinta websites iyo web apps.
    Waxaa muhiim u ah HTML, CSS iyo JavaScript.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 2: HTML</h2>
  <p>
    HTML waxaa loo isticmaalaa dhismaha website-ka. Waxaad ku samayn
    kartaa headings, paragraphs, buttons, images iyo links.
  </p>

  <pre>
&lt;h1&gt;Salaan&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kani waa website-kayga.&lt;/p&gt;
  </pre>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 3: Headings iyo Paragraphs</h2>
  <p>
    Headings waxaa loo isticmaalaa cinwaannada, paragraphs-na qoraalka.
  </p>

  <pre>
&lt;h1&gt;Cinwaan weyn&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Cinwaan kale&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qoraalka website-ka.&lt;/p&gt;
  </pre>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 4: Links</h2>
  <p>
    Link waxaa lagu xiriirin karaa bogag kala duwan.
  </p>

  <pre>
&lt;a href="index.html"&gt;Bogga Hore&lt;/a&gt;
  </pre>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 5: Images</h2>
  <p>
    HTML waxaa lagu dari karaa sawirro iyadoo la isticmaalayo
    element-ka img.
  </p>

  <pre>
&lt;img src="sawir.jpg" alt="Sawir"&gt;
  </pre>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 6: CSS</h2>
  <p>
    CSS waxaa loo isticmaalaa qurxinta website-ka, sida midabada,
    cabbirka qoraalka, background-ka iyo layout-ka.
  </p>

  <pre>
body {
  background: lightblue;
}

h1 {
  color: blue;
}
  </pre>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 7: Buttons</h2>
  <p>
    Button waxaa loo isticmaalaa in user-ku uu sameeyo action.
  </p>

  <pre>
&lt;button&gt;Guji Halkan&lt;/button&gt;
  </pre>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 8: JavaScript</h2>
  <p>
    JavaScript wuxuu website-ka ka dhigayaa mid interactive ah,
    tusaale ahaan button marka la gujiyo inuu sameeyo wax.
  </p>

  <pre>
&lt;button onclick="salaan()"&gt;Guji&lt;/button&gt;

&lt;script&gt;
function salaan() {
  alert("Salaan!");
}
&lt;/script&gt;
  </pre>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 9: Responsive Website</h2>
  <p>
    Responsive design wuxuu website-ka ka dhigaa inuu si fiican uga
    shaqeeyo telefoon, tablet iyo computer.
  </p>

  <pre>
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  h1 {
    font-size: 25px;
  }
}
  </pre>
</div>

<div class="lesson">
  <h2>Casharka 10: Samee Website-kaaga</h2>
  <p>
    Hadda waxaad isku dari kartaa HTML, CSS iyo JavaScript si aad
    u samayso website dhamaystiran.
  </p>

  <pre>
HTML = Dhismaha 🏗️
CSS = Qurxinta 🎨
JavaScript = Dhaqdhaqaaqa ⚡
  </pre>
</div>

